# Read by docker compose for the local stack (`make up` seeds this file).
# Unset, this install signs in at the hosted account hub and looks up
# similar companies in the hosted company universe, with nothing else to
# deploy. Only someone developing the hub itself, with development copies
# of those two services running locally beside this stack, sets the block
# below (identity on localhost for the browser, transport by service name
# for the containers).
# OPENBOWER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:8001
# OPENBOWER_DATA_URL=http://localhost:8003
# OPENBOWER_AUTH_INTERNAL_URL=http://auth:8001
# OPENBOWER_DATA_INTERNAL_URL=http://data:8003
